WEBVTT

00:01.481 --> 00:02.818
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.842 --> 00:04.177
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.201 --> 00:07.417
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.441 --> 00:13.001
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.001 --> 01:30.961
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.121 --> 01:34.361
=Episode 6=

01:38.921 --> 01:42.761
(Ruide Hall)

01:44.041 --> 01:45.041
Why?

01:45.560 --> 01:46.560
I came to bid farewell.

01:46.921 --> 01:47.921
Farewell?

01:48.320 --> 01:49.320
I can do martial arts,

01:50.121 --> 01:51.401
but I used to keep it from you.

01:52.480 --> 01:53.640
I was dishonest.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.840
From this day on,

01:56.921 --> 01:58.401
I no longer dare to stay around you.

01:59.721 --> 02:01.001
Xu Xiao asked you to protect me?

02:02.281 --> 02:03.561
I deceived you, Your Highness.

02:04.400 --> 02:05.400
That's unforgivable.

02:06.400 --> 02:07.481
How many people

02:08.241 --> 02:09.801
has my father arranged for me secretly?

02:11.201 --> 02:12.360
Four death guards.

02:13.281 --> 02:14.561
Alfa, Bravo, Charlie, and Delta.

02:15.320 --> 02:16.320
I'm Charlie.

02:16.720 --> 02:17.801
Who are the other three?

02:18.241 --> 02:19.521
We work independently.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.320
I don't know who they are.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.481
I have to guess, then.

02:26.561 --> 02:27.601
But His Lordship said

02:29.241 --> 02:30.241
that Bravo and Delta...

02:33.320 --> 02:35.001
had died for you.

02:41.361 --> 02:42.680
Two have died for me,

02:44.760 --> 02:46.361
but I don't even know their real names.

02:48.441 --> 02:49.441
Alfa is still alive.

02:50.200 --> 02:51.320
Can it be Hongshu?

02:51.601 --> 02:52.601
I don't know.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.400
I'm in a bad mood today.

03:03.081 --> 03:04.241
This is a punishment for you.

03:06.881 --> 03:08.121
You've got a lot of work to do.

03:08.441 --> 03:09.441
Stop trying to leave.

03:09.760 --> 03:10.760
Get back to your work.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.120
Wait.

03:29.040 --> 03:30.040
Remember.

03:30.801 --> 03:32.001
From this day on,

03:33.161 --> 03:35.161
you're no longer a death guard.

03:37.040 --> 03:38.040
You're only my maid.

03:38.801 --> 03:39.801
Got it?

03:50.280 --> 03:51.280
It feels good.

03:51.481 --> 03:52.481
Off you go.

04:22.361 --> 04:23.880
His Highness is nice to you.

04:24.361 --> 04:26.321
I thought he would expel you.

04:30.840 --> 04:31.840
From this day on,

04:32.440 --> 04:33.560
I'm no longer a death guard.

04:34.600 --> 04:36.081
I'm the maid for His Highness,

04:36.720 --> 04:37.720
Qingniao.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.680
What about you?

04:40.201 --> 04:42.241
Why did you come to His Highness?

04:43.680 --> 04:44.801
What is

04:45.201 --> 04:46.201
your real identity?

04:49.560 --> 04:50.560
Guess.

05:21.801 --> 05:22.801
Nothing.

05:25.720 --> 05:26.961
I've got nothing to do,

05:28.400 --> 05:29.760
so that I want to talk to someone.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.440
Qingniao turns out

05:47.441 --> 05:48.360
to be a death guard

05:48.400 --> 05:49.640
whom my father arranged for me.

05:56.121 --> 05:57.201
She told me

05:58.001 --> 05:59.681
there were four death guards around me.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.240
Two of them have died.

06:01.761 --> 06:02.761
The last one

06:04.761 --> 06:05.801
is still hiding around me.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.800
Can you do martial arts?

06:17.961 --> 06:19.800
Yes, I guess.

06:21.081 --> 06:22.297
Then you're the last death guard

06:22.321 --> 06:23.401
staying secretly around me.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.480
I'm not.

06:28.160 --> 06:29.160
Me?

06:35.561 --> 06:36.561
You don't look like one.

06:41.961 --> 06:42.961
You...

06:43.280 --> 06:44.280
You can do martial arts?

06:45.201 --> 06:46.201
A little.

06:46.360 --> 06:47.640
How great are your martial arts?

06:50.561 --> 06:51.561
This great.

06:53.001 --> 06:54.177
But every time bandits ran after me,

06:54.201 --> 06:55.816
you escaped faster than me!

06:55.840 --> 06:56.737
I have great martial arts.

06:56.761 --> 06:57.280
I can't...

06:57.321 --> 06:58.360
I can't easily fight.

06:58.561 --> 06:59.641
Or people will die.

06:59.720 --> 07:00.920
Don't brag!

07:02.600 --> 07:04.761
I shouldn't have guessed
that you were a death guard.

07:05.001 --> 07:05.681
No masters

07:05.720 --> 07:06.881
would behave like you.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.240
When you stole a chicken,

07:08.321 --> 07:09.761
half of the villagers ran after you.

07:18.160 --> 07:19.160
Old Huang.

07:20.400 --> 07:22.001
Xu Xiao asked me to make a choice.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.120
I should either kill Ning Emei

07:26.040 --> 07:27.040
or

07:27.761 --> 07:29.201
Send Huangman'er out of North Liang.

07:37.561 --> 07:38.561
Young Master.

07:43.160 --> 07:45.040
Someone in the army supports Huangman'er

07:45.441 --> 07:46.521
in taking over North Liang.

08:02.201 --> 08:03.521
That's basically what happened.

08:04.280 --> 08:05.480
Even I don't know

08:06.321 --> 08:08.321
where Xu Xiao will send Huangman'er.

08:11.761 --> 08:12.761
I...

08:14.720 --> 08:16.160
I guess I know

08:16.201 --> 08:17.201
where His Lordship

08:17.400 --> 08:18.881
will send Young Master Longxiang.

08:21.920 --> 08:22.920
You do?

08:25.201 --> 08:26.776
It doesn't matter where he will be sent.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.600
The point is...

08:27.641 --> 08:28.641
Young Master,

08:28.800 --> 08:30.240
do you not want him to leave?

08:30.561 --> 08:31.561
I don't, of course!

08:36.720 --> 08:38.360
But my point doesn't help at all.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.881
I didn't want it

08:44.001 --> 08:45.241
when my sisters were sent away.

08:46.881 --> 08:48.281
They were still sent away, at last.

08:53.521 --> 08:54.521
I am

08:55.561 --> 08:57.040
a young master unworthy of the name.

08:59.800 --> 09:00.800
Young Master,

09:02.681 --> 09:03.681
these days,

09:04.081 --> 09:05.081
I've been thinking

09:05.881 --> 09:08.840
about what we experienced
in the past three years.

09:13.081 --> 09:14.160
I'm...

09:15.521 --> 09:16.321
I'm useless.

09:16.400 --> 09:17.400
However,

09:18.400 --> 09:20.121
I still want to help you.

09:26.521 --> 09:27.881
I'm glad you think so.

09:44.881 --> 09:47.081
You know Old Hunk
under the Lake, don't you?

09:48.400 --> 09:49.400
I certainly do.

09:50.521 --> 09:52.240
When Mr. Lin assassinated me,

09:52.761 --> 09:53.961
I begged Old Hunk for help.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.480
Then have you thought

09:55.521 --> 09:56.800
about releasing him?

09:57.400 --> 09:58.641
I tried when I was little.

09:59.720 --> 10:00.720
The chain on him

10:00.961 --> 10:01.961
couldn't be cut off.

10:08.720 --> 10:10.281
So, Young Master,

10:10.480 --> 10:11.640
what you need

10:13.000 --> 10:15.000
is a sharp blade.

10:32.840 --> 10:33.840
What's up?

10:34.000 --> 10:35.000
Where's Grandpa Wei?

10:39.401 --> 10:40.401
He's asleep.

10:40.760 --> 10:41.760
That's good.

10:45.081 --> 10:46.281
Actually, I came to see you.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.360
You once told me

10:51.360 --> 10:53.000
that you had a very sharp blade.

10:53.681 --> 10:54.840
This is it, right?

10:55.240 --> 10:56.401
Chunlei, isn't it?

10:58.360 --> 10:59.360
Just get to the point.

11:00.041 --> 11:01.081
May I borrow it?

11:02.281 --> 11:02.801
For a while.

11:02.921 --> 11:03.921
I'll return it soon.

11:04.201 --> 11:05.201
What do you need it for?

11:06.441 --> 11:07.441
Under the lake,

11:07.760 --> 11:08.401
an old hunk has been locked

11:08.520 --> 11:10.120
for any years.

11:10.880 --> 11:11.960
I want to borrow your blade

11:12.081 --> 11:13.081
and release him.

11:15.000 --> 11:16.240
Why do you want to release him?

11:17.281 --> 11:18.281
If I save him,

11:18.681 --> 11:19.880
maybe he'll help me, too.

11:21.321 --> 11:22.321
Who told you that?

11:23.041 --> 11:24.041
Old Huang!

11:40.640 --> 11:41.640
Old Huang.

11:42.201 --> 11:42.961
Tell her

11:43.041 --> 11:44.241
about Old Hunk under the Lake.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.161
The man under the Lake

11:47.240 --> 11:50.161
is locked by four meteorite iron chains.

11:50.321 --> 11:51.441
If someone can

11:51.480 --> 11:52.880
cut off the chains

11:52.921 --> 11:53.681
and help him leave,

11:53.720 --> 11:55.000
he will

11:55.081 --> 11:56.081
be conquered.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.000
You believe that?

12:05.201 --> 12:06.281
I'd like to have a try.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.000
Don't you have enough helpers already?

12:12.760 --> 12:13.760
In some cases,

12:13.880 --> 12:15.441
my father's men may not help me.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.177
How could you throw your blade

12:23.201 --> 12:24.496
at someone who doesn't do martial arts?

12:24.520 --> 12:25.840
What if you hurt me?

12:35.561 --> 12:37.161
Do you think this blade will be helpful?

12:37.561 --> 12:38.561
It looks shining.

12:38.681 --> 12:39.761
It'll be helpful, I assume.

12:40.120 --> 12:41.377
All blades are shining,
except for wooden ones.

12:41.401 --> 12:42.161
Give it back to me, then.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.240
Fine. Fine.

12:43.441 --> 12:44.441
I'm going down.

12:49.520 --> 12:50.777
Will there be any problem
if I release him?

12:50.801 --> 12:51.841
Don't worry, Young Master.

12:52.240 --> 12:53.240
I'm here.

15:07.081 --> 15:08.081
Young Master.

15:10.240 --> 15:11.240
Oh, my waist hurts.

15:13.880 --> 15:14.880
Where's my blade?

15:16.120 --> 15:17.281
Old Hunk is holding it.

15:17.600 --> 15:18.720
He looked like

15:19.081 --> 15:20.241
he wanted to unchain himself.

16:00.521 --> 16:03.641
(Imposing and Magnificent)

16:26.840 --> 16:27.921
Have I made it?

16:28.120 --> 16:29.120
Sure.

16:53.281 --> 16:58.481
(Tingchao Pavilion)

17:19.281 --> 17:20.281
Get back!

18:04.081 --> 18:09.121
(Tingchao Pavilion)

18:12.600 --> 18:13.681
Amazing.

18:13.880 --> 18:14.401
Old Huang.

18:14.561 --> 18:15.561
Isn't he awesome?

19:00.881 --> 19:02.760
Is Li Yishan still alive?

19:04.881 --> 19:06.761
After being locked underwater
for so many years,

19:08.881 --> 19:10.161
you can still speak.

19:29.040 --> 19:30.040
Don't fight him!

19:31.201 --> 19:32.201
Go away.

19:55.361 --> 19:56.121
Young man,

19:56.280 --> 19:57.280
don't risk your neck.

19:57.401 --> 19:59.000
I saved you.

19:59.161 --> 20:00.641
That's why I keep you alive now.

20:00.800 --> 20:01.800
I...

20:03.720 --> 20:04.961
He'll be conquered?

20:08.841 --> 20:10.001
I'm asking you one last time.

20:11.000 --> 20:12.441
Where's Li Yishan?

20:18.881 --> 20:20.177
(Imposing and Magnificent)

20:39.201 --> 20:42.481
(Propitious Omens)

20:58.841 --> 21:01.001
(Imposing and Magnificent)

21:11.601 --> 21:12.601
Li Yishan,

21:13.441 --> 21:14.561
I'm glad you're still alive.

21:15.280 --> 21:16.280
Otherwise,

21:16.681 --> 21:18.121
I wouldn't know how to take revenge.

21:18.320 --> 21:19.320
Li Yishan?

21:20.201 --> 21:21.361
The Supreme Master?

21:22.520 --> 21:23.601
Isn't he dead?

21:24.320 --> 21:25.401
He's your master?

21:56.601 --> 21:58.401
(Imposing and Magnificent)

22:08.561 --> 22:09.561
(Propitious Omens)

22:12.800 --> 22:13.201
Old Huang,

22:13.361 --> 22:14.480
what a bad idea you had!

22:14.520 --> 22:15.441
Didn't you say after I released him,

22:15.480 --> 22:16.520
he would be conquered?

22:16.921 --> 22:18.401
Let's fight him until he's conquered.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.720
Go.

22:52.241 --> 22:55.561
(Propitious Omens)

22:56.080 --> 22:57.080
Seriously?

23:02.121 --> 23:03.401
Jian Jiuhuang?

23:11.201 --> 23:12.361
You're still alive, too.

23:15.441 --> 23:16.441
Very well.

23:17.040 --> 23:18.760
I'm going to defeat you

23:19.760 --> 23:21.400
and take revenge
for my failure last time.

23:26.641 --> 23:27.641
The First Move,

23:28.921 --> 23:29.921
Dragon and Snake.

23:37.121 --> 23:38.121
The Second Move,

23:38.921 --> 23:39.921
Twin Lotus.

24:09.361 --> 24:10.441
Old Huang?

24:12.520 --> 24:13.441
Wait a minute, Young Master.

24:13.480 --> 24:14.480
This isn't over yet.

24:15.961 --> 24:16.760
That year,

24:16.921 --> 24:18.480
I knocked you into the lake.

24:18.760 --> 24:19.961
Today,

24:20.320 --> 24:21.441
you'll end up the same way.

24:22.121 --> 24:23.121
The Third Move,

24:23.881 --> 24:24.881
Three Catties.

25:12.161 --> 25:14.521
(Propitious Omens)

25:31.401 --> 25:32.441
I haven't had enough food.

25:32.760 --> 25:33.760
I'll stop fighting.

25:42.121 --> 25:42.641
Old Huang, you...

25:42.881 --> 25:43.881
You...

25:53.080 --> 25:53.618
Young Master.

25:53.642 --> 25:55.057
(Propitious Omens)

25:55.081 --> 25:56.081
He's conquered!

25:56.760 --> 25:57.618
Old Huang,

25:57.642 --> 25:58.841
you...

25:58.881 --> 26:00.201
You have such great martial arts?

26:00.520 --> 26:00.841
Young Master,

26:00.881 --> 26:02.560
didn't I tell you?

26:02.641 --> 26:03.681
I have great martial arts.

26:03.921 --> 26:05.040
Like this great.

26:16.520 --> 26:18.921
Deng Tai'e has only a peach blossom.

26:19.681 --> 26:21.520
But Jian Jiuhuang's sword box

26:21.720 --> 26:22.720
is full of famous swords.

26:24.361 --> 26:25.361
I'm going to get changed.

26:25.601 --> 26:26.601
I want some meat!

26:35.520 --> 26:36.560
You're Jian Jiuhuang.

26:37.401 --> 26:38.401
You know him?

26:38.841 --> 26:40.201
In recent 50 years,

26:40.961 --> 26:42.361
besides God of Sword Li Chungang,

26:42.881 --> 26:44.441
there have been only two sword masters.

26:45.040 --> 26:47.120
One is Deng Tai'e,
New God of Sword of Peach Blossom.

26:47.641 --> 26:48.641
The other one

26:49.841 --> 26:50.841
is him.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.800
Take it away. Take it away.

27:10.320 --> 27:12.240
You've had fish for a dozen years.

27:19.161 --> 27:20.161
No more fight?

27:24.320 --> 27:25.560
I'm going to sleep, then.

27:34.441 --> 27:35.761
Would you like to have some food?

27:36.560 --> 27:37.720
I'm going to do some reading.

27:43.760 --> 27:44.201
Tell me.

27:44.760 --> 27:45.760
Why did you release me?

27:48.000 --> 27:49.000
Young Master saved you.

27:49.520 --> 27:50.520
Shouldn't you repay him?

27:50.560 --> 27:51.560
Nonsense.

27:52.681 --> 27:53.841
He released me.

27:54.480 --> 27:55.617
At most, I'll show some mercy

27:55.641 --> 27:56.641
and won't kill him.

27:57.161 --> 27:58.161
Why must I repay him?

28:05.080 --> 28:06.080
If you don't repay him,

28:06.760 --> 28:07.760
I'll kick you

28:08.280 --> 28:09.520
back to the bottom of the lake.

28:18.121 --> 28:19.121
I'm not in a hurry.

28:20.080 --> 28:21.080
Take your time.

28:21.121 --> 28:22.121
After you're done eating,

28:23.161 --> 28:24.161
give me your reply.

28:29.401 --> 28:29.800
Young Master,

28:29.881 --> 28:30.216
have the meat

28:30.240 --> 28:31.080
when it's still hot.

28:31.121 --> 28:32.361
It'll taste bad when it's cold.

28:32.560 --> 28:33.560
Come on.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.320
Have you made up your mind?

28:47.080 --> 28:48.360
How do you want me to repay him?

28:49.560 --> 28:50.560
Stay in the Mansion

28:51.000 --> 28:52.000
and protect Young Master.

28:52.881 --> 28:53.881
When you're around,

28:54.361 --> 28:55.401
why does he still need me?

28:56.601 --> 28:57.601
I'm leaving soon.

28:57.961 --> 28:58.961
Before I come back,

28:59.601 --> 29:00.721
protect Young Master for me.

29:01.441 --> 29:02.441
You're leaving?

29:05.000 --> 29:06.600
I'll tell you about it later, all right?

29:09.080 --> 29:10.080
All right.

29:24.000 --> 29:25.000
What do you say?

29:25.441 --> 29:26.441
When will you come back?

29:27.161 --> 29:28.161
Within two months.

29:28.520 --> 29:29.520
All right.

29:29.961 --> 29:30.961
In two months,

29:31.080 --> 29:31.617
even if you're not back,

29:31.641 --> 29:32.641
I'll be still leaving.

29:33.720 --> 29:34.720
Deal.

29:41.841 --> 29:44.561
(Wutong House)

29:57.641 --> 29:59.361
Let me take off your shoes.

29:59.841 --> 30:01.641
Make yourself comfortable
in your own room.

30:01.961 --> 30:03.161
I can take them off by myself.

30:03.441 --> 30:04.681
Then what do you need us for?

30:08.720 --> 30:09.720
Qingniao,

30:10.800 --> 30:12.760
when I have Old Huang
and Old Hunk under the Lake,

30:12.881 --> 30:14.361
you don't need to be a death guard.

30:15.921 --> 30:18.641
Just be my maid without concern.

30:19.921 --> 30:21.961
You care so much
for Qingniao, Your Highness.

30:22.961 --> 30:23.961
I care for you, too.

30:24.881 --> 30:26.601
In case of danger, stay far away.

30:27.040 --> 30:28.040
No one in my house

30:28.441 --> 30:30.080
should die before me.

30:38.321 --> 30:39.897
What shall I ask him for?

30:39.921 --> 30:40.921
Old Huang.

30:42.800 --> 30:43.800
Here's the wine.

30:45.560 --> 30:46.841
Master Huang.

30:47.280 --> 30:48.480
Let me fill your cup.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.720
Old Huang.

30:51.161 --> 30:52.401
What you said this afternoon...

30:54.201 --> 30:55.201
Young Master,

30:55.760 --> 30:58.897
how many eggs did we take away
when we stole the chicken?

30:58.921 --> 31:00.280
Two or three?

31:07.000 --> 31:07.641
Three.

31:07.800 --> 31:09.040
I knew it.

31:10.401 --> 31:11.401
Old Huang,

31:11.681 --> 31:13.520
you said you would be leaving.

31:13.841 --> 31:14.441
Where are you going?

31:14.480 --> 31:16.961
I'm going to Mount Longhu.

31:17.921 --> 31:19.480
The biggest sect in Liyang?

31:20.201 --> 31:21.201
Why are you going there?

31:21.921 --> 31:23.361
Some old friends of mine live there.

31:23.720 --> 31:24.720
I'm going to visit them.

31:28.280 --> 31:29.280
After that,

31:29.480 --> 31:30.641
I have to

31:32.681 --> 31:33.681
visit Wudi City.

31:34.080 --> 31:35.401
East Sea Wudi City?

31:36.320 --> 31:37.480
Why will you go there?

31:38.841 --> 31:39.921
There's a fight

31:40.601 --> 31:41.601
I stopped halfway.

31:42.401 --> 31:43.481
I have to go and finish it.

31:44.441 --> 31:45.217
Since I was old enough
to remember things,

31:45.241 --> 31:46.521
you've been living in my family.

31:47.080 --> 31:48.480
When did you have the fight?

31:49.080 --> 31:50.161
Nearly 30 years ago.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.000
I wasn't even born at that time.

31:54.760 --> 31:56.881
Would you like to listen to my story?

31:58.520 --> 31:59.520
I'm all ears.

32:04.841 --> 32:06.320
It's quite a simple story.

32:07.121 --> 32:08.760
I used to be a swordsmith.

32:09.760 --> 32:11.401
As I forged swords,

32:11.800 --> 32:14.000
I suddenly began
to understand swordsmanship.

32:14.800 --> 32:16.121
Then I became a swordsman.

32:18.480 --> 32:19.760
So easy?

32:19.921 --> 32:20.921
I just had good luck.

32:22.000 --> 32:23.000
Go on.

32:23.201 --> 32:25.520
Then I traveled around the world

32:26.641 --> 32:28.320
and collected famous swords

32:28.961 --> 32:30.201
for my sword box.

32:31.080 --> 32:32.201
This box?

32:32.240 --> 32:33.240
Famous swords in it?

32:33.441 --> 32:35.280
There are Top Ten Famous Swords.

32:35.881 --> 32:36.881
In my sword box,

32:39.040 --> 32:40.320
there were six of them.

32:41.240 --> 32:42.240
Were?

32:43.480 --> 32:44.800
When I visited East Sea Wudi City

32:44.841 --> 32:46.201
and challenged Wang Xianzhi there,

32:46.961 --> 32:48.361
I left Sword Huanglu

32:49.560 --> 32:50.921
in the city wall.

32:51.041 --> 32:54.361
(Wudi City)

33:06.401 --> 33:07.401
I lost.

33:10.841 --> 33:11.841
I lost.

33:12.681 --> 33:14.161
It's no big deal.

33:15.201 --> 33:16.961
Some battles you win,
some battles you lose.

33:18.040 --> 33:20.240
Halfway through the fight,
I knew I would lose.

33:21.161 --> 33:22.881
I was so scared.

33:24.161 --> 33:25.161
Of death.

33:25.760 --> 33:26.760
Of defeat.

33:29.841 --> 33:30.841
Then I ran away.

33:32.121 --> 33:33.841
In several years after I left Wudi City,

33:33.881 --> 33:35.161
I had a nightmare every night

33:36.560 --> 33:38.441
where I was defeated by Wang Xianzhi

33:38.720 --> 33:39.841
and I died.

33:44.361 --> 33:46.401
Young Master, do you know
why I came to North Liang?

33:47.601 --> 33:49.841
Because North Liang is far away
from the East Sea!

33:54.121 --> 33:56.201
I've been hiding like a rat.

33:57.240 --> 33:58.617
I don't dare to confront Wudi City

33:58.641 --> 34:00.280
or Wang Xianzhi.

34:01.760 --> 34:02.760
I had thought

34:04.040 --> 34:05.361
this would be my life.

34:07.320 --> 34:10.560
I didn't get through this

34:11.480 --> 34:13.120
until I traveled with you
for three years.

34:14.961 --> 34:16.480
How did our trip help?

34:17.881 --> 34:18.881
Young Master,

34:20.240 --> 34:21.520
you can't do martial arts.

34:22.760 --> 34:23.960
But over the past three years,

34:24.480 --> 34:25.681
you've never evaded,

34:27.240 --> 34:28.320
shrunk back,

34:30.320 --> 34:31.320
nor felt scared.

34:33.000 --> 34:34.000
How shall I put it?

34:34.760 --> 34:36.560
Suddenly, I'm no longer
afraid of anything.

34:38.560 --> 34:39.080
Defeat...

34:39.441 --> 34:39.818
Death...

34:39.842 --> 34:40.881
No big deal.

34:41.641 --> 34:42.641
Eventually,

34:44.320 --> 34:45.361
I can confront

34:46.080 --> 34:46.898
Wudi City

34:46.922 --> 34:48.601
that has haunted me for 30 years.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.897
At last, I can confront Wang Xianzhi

34:50.921 --> 34:53.040
who haunts in my heart.

35:01.681 --> 35:02.681
I won't stop you

35:05.760 --> 35:07.000
from challenging him.

35:11.000 --> 35:12.560
But you must come back after it's over.

35:13.280 --> 35:14.577
Others don't broil sweet potatoes

35:14.601 --> 35:15.601
as well as you do.

35:16.161 --> 35:17.281
I promise you, Young Master.

35:17.361 --> 35:18.536
I'll come back immediately
after I fight him.

35:18.560 --> 35:21.200
The first thing I'm going to do
is to broil sweet potatoes for you.

35:38.961 --> 35:40.001
You're going to Wudi City,

35:40.241 --> 35:41.361
aren't you?

35:41.881 --> 35:43.681
Why are you going
to Mount Longhu before that?

35:44.441 --> 35:45.361
To do business.

35:45.401 --> 35:46.761
With people on Mount Longhu?

35:47.401 --> 35:49.200
An old man on Mount Longhu

35:49.520 --> 35:51.921
always wants to know
how strong Wang Xianzhi can be.

35:52.040 --> 35:53.576
But he doesn't dare
to challenge Wang Xianzhi at all.

35:53.600 --> 35:54.697
When he knows
I'm going to challenge Wang Xianzhi,

35:54.721 --> 35:56.841
he'll watch it happily.

35:57.321 --> 35:58.777
It's a chance for business, isn't it?

35:58.801 --> 36:00.600
You'll challenge Wang Xianzhi, anyway.

36:01.160 --> 36:02.160
You can take the chance

36:02.560 --> 36:03.656
to ask that man for something.

36:03.680 --> 36:04.801
Of course.

36:04.961 --> 36:06.560
I won't waste the chance.

36:06.961 --> 36:08.081
What do you want to ask for?

36:09.600 --> 36:10.600
It's a secret.

36:11.241 --> 36:12.761
You'll know it later.

36:14.921 --> 36:16.480
You old rascal.

36:20.841 --> 36:21.841
When are you leaving?

36:22.120 --> 36:23.120
Early tomorrow morning.

36:25.600 --> 36:26.600
In such a hurry?

36:27.921 --> 36:29.377
The fight has been delayed for 30 years.

36:29.401 --> 36:30.120
The earlier it's over,

36:30.281 --> 36:31.961
the earlier
I'll take the load off my mind.

36:44.881 --> 36:45.881
Old Huang.

36:48.241 --> 36:51.120
How does your song go?

37:06.241 --> 37:09.441
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

37:10.921 --> 37:14.241
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

37:15.721 --> 37:19.000
♪ Buried in the earth ♪

37:20.520 --> 37:24.281
♪ Distress in the joy ♪

37:25.281 --> 37:28.640
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

37:29.961 --> 37:34.000
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

38:23.680 --> 38:24.281
Old Huang,

38:24.401 --> 38:25.401
it turns out to be a song

38:25.520 --> 38:27.200
about your own story.

38:27.801 --> 38:29.200
Yes, isn't it?

38:32.801 --> 38:33.801
I'm known

38:34.160 --> 38:35.680
as Jian Jiuhuang.

38:38.000 --> 38:42.040
Actually, I haven't figured out
the ninth move yet.

38:43.321 --> 38:45.560
When I traveled with you
for three years,

38:46.281 --> 38:48.640
I brought together our experiences.

38:49.441 --> 38:50.441
Then,

38:51.441 --> 38:52.881
I figured out the ninth move.

38:53.680 --> 38:54.881
That's good, isn't it?

38:55.321 --> 38:56.321
Young Master,

38:56.640 --> 38:57.801
how about

38:58.200 --> 38:59.480
naming the ninth move?

39:04.761 --> 39:05.881
In the past three years,

39:06.881 --> 39:07.881
how far have we traveled?

39:09.241 --> 39:11.656
Six thousand li in total, I'm afraid.
[♪li: a unit of length, equals to 500 meters]

39:11.680 --> 39:12.880
Call it Six Thousand Li, then.

39:13.841 --> 39:15.321
Change it later if you don't like it.

39:17.721 --> 39:18.801
Let's take this name.

39:19.721 --> 39:20.721
The Ninth Move,

39:20.961 --> 39:23.080
Six Thousand Li!

39:30.721 --> 39:32.561
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

39:49.801 --> 39:51.496
Young Master, learning martial arts
doesn't hurt anything.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.721
You won't be fooled, either.

39:52.921 --> 39:54.257
- How many times have I told you?
- You just take it...

39:54.281 --> 39:55.281
I won't.

39:55.881 --> 39:57.161
I just won't learn martial arts.

39:57.241 --> 39:58.241
Are you sure?

39:58.801 --> 40:00.200
If you get in trouble,

40:00.640 --> 40:01.338
I have two sentences for you

40:01.362 --> 40:02.480
which will help a lot.

40:03.241 --> 40:04.561
- I know that, too.
- Something...

40:05.441 --> 40:06.441
Something's wrong.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.000
Leave immediately.

40:19.680 --> 40:21.840
- I have something for you.
- I have something for you.

40:46.721 --> 40:49.160
It's tasty salt.

41:04.881 --> 41:06.337
What do you want to tell Young Master?

41:06.361 --> 41:07.361
Just say it.

41:08.361 --> 41:09.361
It said,

41:09.921 --> 41:10.921
"Young Master,

41:11.841 --> 41:12.961
don't bother to see me out."

41:19.881 --> 41:20.881
Go.

41:21.680 --> 41:22.880
I'll walk you out of the town.

41:44.680 --> 41:45.600
Young Master,

41:45.680 --> 41:46.680
this is where you stop.

42:21.560 --> 42:22.680
Is Wang Xianzhi very strong?

42:23.080 --> 42:24.080
He's the Second Best.

42:24.401 --> 42:25.401
Who's the best, then?

42:25.881 --> 42:27.401
When he calls himself the Second Best,

42:27.600 --> 42:29.480
no one else dares to be the best.

42:30.761 --> 42:31.801
Can you defeat him?

42:31.921 --> 42:32.921
I don't care!

42:33.801 --> 42:35.257
I don't care whether I'll win or lose.

42:35.281 --> 42:36.857
The fight has been delayed for 30 years.

42:36.881 --> 42:37.721
I have to finish it.

42:37.841 --> 42:39.201
Come back quickly after it's over.

42:39.721 --> 42:40.761
Young Master, wait for me.

42:40.881 --> 42:42.056
I'll bring back the wine
from the East Sea

42:42.080 --> 42:43.136
and let's enjoy it together.

42:43.160 --> 42:44.160
All right.

44:56.761 --> 45:00.601
♪ The flower of pain ♪
